   "अप॑ नः॒ शोशु॑चद॒घम्"
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
   "su̱kṣe̱tri̱yā sṷgātu̱yā va̭sū̱yā ca̭ yajāmahe",
   "apa̭ na̱ḥ śośṷcada̱gham"
